#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:4
msgid "Tutorial"
msgstr "教程"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:6
msgid "The SO-101 arm picking up a vial and placing it in a rack."
msgstr "SO-101 机械臂拾取样品瓶并将其放入支架。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:13
msgid ""
"This tutorial ties in with the `NVIDIA Sim-to-Real SO-101 learning course "
"<https://docs.nvidia.com/learning/physical-ai/sim-to-real-"
"so-101/latest/index.html>`__ and its `workshop repository "
"<https://github.com/isaac-sim/Sim-to-Real-SO-101-Workshop>`__, which present"
" a broader end-to-end physical AI workflow with the SO-101, Isaac Lab, and "
"NVIDIA Isaac GR00T."
msgstr ""
"本教程与 `NVIDIA Sim-to-Real SO-101 学习课程 "
"<https://docs.nvidia.com/learning/physical-ai/sim-to-real-"
"so-101/latest/index.html>`__ 及其 `工作坊仓库 <https://github.com/isaac-sim/Sim-to-"
"Real-SO-101-Workshop>`__ 相衔接。课程使用 SO-101、Isaac Lab 和 NVIDIA Isaac "
"GR00T，介绍更完整的端到端物理 AI 工作流程。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:18
msgid ""
"This tutorial builds a complete robot-learning workflow around an `SO-101 "
"arm <https://github.com/TheRobotStudio/SO-ARM100>`__ that picks up a vial "
"and places it in a rack. Instead of assembling disconnected examples, you "
"will work with a production-shaped downstream project: `IsaacLabTutorial "
"main branch <https://github.com/isaac-sim/IsaacLabTutorial/tree/main>`__. "
"The project includes the robot and workshop assets, a manager-based "
"reinforcement-learning environment, state and wrist-camera observations, "
"RSL-RL agent configurations, tests, state-policy training, state-to-vision "
"policy distillation, and an optional sim-to-real profile for running the "
"camera policy on a physical SO-101."
msgstr ""
"本教程围绕 `SO-101 机械臂 <https://github.com/TheRobotStudio/SO-ARM100>`__ "
"抓取小瓶并放入瓶架的任务，构建完整的机器人学习流程。教程采用一个接近实际工程结构的下游项目：`IsaacLabTutorial 的 main 分支 "
"<https://github.com/isaac-"
"sim/IsaacLabTutorial/tree/main>`__，各环节在同一项目中衔接。项目包含机器人与工作台资产、基于管理器的强化学习环境、状态与腕部相机观测、RSL-"
"RL 智能体配置、测试、状态策略训练、从状态策略到视觉策略的蒸馏，以及可选的仿真到现实配置，用于在真实 SO-101 上运行相机策略。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:26
msgid ""
"By the end, you will know how a downstream Isaac Lab task is packaged, "
"discovered, validated, trained, and evaluated. You will also know where to "
"change the robot, scene, MDP, and learning configuration for your own task."
msgstr ""
"完成本教程后，你将了解下游 Isaac Lab 任务如何打包、被发现、验证、训练和评估，也会知道如何修改机器人、场景、MDP "
"和学习配置，以实现自己的任务。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:31
msgid "Navigate the tutorial"
msgstr "教程导航"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:36
msgid "1. Set up"
msgstr "1. 配置环境"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:40
msgid "Install the project and verify task discovery."
msgstr "安装项目并验证任务发现机制。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:42 source/setup/tutorial.rst:139
msgid "2. Tour the project"
msgstr "2. 浏览项目"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:46
msgid "Find the assets, task terms, configurations, and tests."
msgstr "找到资源、任务项、配置和测试。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:48 source/setup/tutorial.rst:187
msgid "3. Understand the task"
msgstr "3. 理解任务"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:52
msgid ""
"Connect the scene, actions, observations, resets, rewards, and physics."
msgstr "了解场景、动作、观测、重置、奖励和物理仿真之间的关系。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:54
msgid "4. Validate"
msgstr "4. 验证"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:58
msgid "Run tests, a zero-agent smoke test, and a benchmark."
msgstr "运行测试、零动作智能体检查和性能测试。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:60 source/setup/tutorial.rst:318
msgid "5. Train and evaluate"
msgstr "5. 训练与评估"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:64
msgid ""
"Train a state teacher, distill a wrist-camera policy, and measure success."
msgstr "训练基于状态的教师策略，蒸馏腕部相机策略，并测量成功率。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:66 source/setup/tutorial.rst:424
msgid "6. Make it yours"
msgstr "6. 改造为自己的任务"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:70
msgid "Adapt the task without tangling reusable and robot-specific code."
msgstr "调整任务，同时保持可复用代码与机器人专用代码的边界。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:75
msgid "1. Set up the project"
msgstr "1. 配置项目"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:77
msgid ""
"You need Python 3.12, `uv <https://docs.astral.sh/uv/>`__, Git with `Git LFS"
" <https://git-lfs.com/>`__, and an NVIDIA GPU on Linux or Windows. The "
"tutorial uses Newton with the MJWarp solver, so it does not require the "
"Isaac Sim application. Review the :ref:`system requirements <installation-"
"system-requirements>` before starting."
msgstr ""
"需要 Python 3.12、`uv <https://docs.astral.sh/uv/>`__、Git 和 `Git LFS "
"<https://git-lfs.com/>`__，以及运行 Linux 或 Windows 的 NVIDIA GPU 计算机。教程使用 Newton "
"的 MJWarp 求解器，无需安装 Isaac Sim 应用。开始前请查看 :ref:`系统要求 <installation-system-"
"requirements>` 。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:81
msgid ""
"Every command on this page is a single line, so it runs unchanged in bash, "
"PowerShell, and Command Prompt."
msgstr "本页所有命令均为单行命令，可直接在 bash、PowerShell 和命令提示符中运行，无需修改。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:83
msgid "Clone the tutorial's ``main`` branch and create its environment:"
msgstr "克隆教程的 ``main`` 分支并创建环境："

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:91
msgid ""
"The project pins Isaac Lab's ``release/3.0.0`` branch through "
"``pyproject.toml``, so it does not require a sibling Isaac Lab checkout. "
"``uv sync`` creates the environment and installs the tutorial, Isaac Lab, "
"and their runtime dependencies."
msgstr ""
"项目通过 ``pyproject.toml`` 固定使用 Isaac Lab 的 ``release/3.0.0`` 分支，无需在相邻目录额外检出 "
"Isaac Lab。``uv sync`` 会创建环境，并安装教程、Isaac Lab 及其运行时依赖。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:95
msgid ""
"This repository is also a complete example of the downstream project "
"produced by the :doc:`Isaac Lab template generator </source/developer-"
"tools/template_generator>`. Use the generator when starting your own "
"project, then follow the same package layout and task-discovery pattern "
"shown here."
msgstr ""
"此仓库也是 :doc:`Isaac Lab 模板生成器 </source/developer-tools/template_generator>` "
"所生成下游项目的完整示例。创建自己的项目时，可使用模板生成器，再沿用此处的包布局和任务发现方式。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:99
msgid "Confirm that the shared CLI discovers the downstream package:"
msgstr "确认统一 CLI 能发现下游软件包："

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:106
msgid ""
"The second command should include ``isaaclab_tutorial``. Task discovery "
"works because the project publishes an ``isaaclab.tasks`` entry point:"
msgstr ""
"第二条命令的输出应包含 ``isaaclab_tutorial``。任务之所以能够被发现，是因为项目提供了 ``isaaclab.tasks`` "
"入口点："

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:109
msgid "pyproject.toml"
msgstr "pyproject.toml"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:115
msgid "Importing that package registers two Gymnasium task IDs:"
msgstr "导入该软件包会注册两个 Gymnasium 任务 ID："

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:121
msgid "Task ID"
msgstr "任务 ID"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:122
msgid "Policy observations"
msgstr "策略观测"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:123
msgid "``IsaacTutorial-Place-Vial-SO101``"
msgstr "``IsaacTutorial-Place-Vial-SO101``"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:124
msgid "Robot, vial, rack, placement, and progress state, trained with PPO"
msgstr "机器人、小瓶、瓶架、放置情况和进度状态，使用 PPO 训练"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:125
msgid "``IsaacTutorial-Place-Vial-SO101-Camera``"
msgstr "``IsaacTutorial-Place-Vial-SO101-Camera``"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:126
msgid ""
"64 by 48 wrist RGB plus proprioception, distilled from a trained state "
"policy"
msgstr "64 × 48 腕部 RGB 图像与本体感知信息，由训练好的状态策略蒸馏得到"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:128
msgid ""
"Adding ``presets=sim2real`` to either task enables the randomization used "
"for robot transfer (see :ref:`tutorial-so101-sim2real`)."
msgstr ""
"为任一任务添加 ``presets=sim2real``，即可启用向真实机器人迁移所用的随机化，见 :ref:`tutorial-"
"so101-sim2real` 。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:133
msgid ""
"Run all remaining commands from the ``IsaacLabTutorial`` directory. Train "
"the state task first: it is the baseline and supplies the teacher checkpoint"
" used by the camera task."
msgstr "后续命令均在 ``IsaacLabTutorial`` 目录中运行。先训练状态任务：它既是基线，也提供相机任务所需的教师检查点。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:141
msgid ""
"The project keeps reusable task logic separate from SO-101-specific "
"configuration:"
msgstr "项目将可复用的任务逻辑与 SO-101 专用配置分开："

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:161
msgid ""
"This boundary is intentional. A new robot gets a sibling of ``config/so101``"
" and reuses the vial-placement MDP. A different manipulation problem gets a "
"sibling of ``tasks/place_vial`` and owns its task terms."
msgstr ""
"这样的划分是有意设计的。添加新机器人时，创建与 ``config/so101`` 并列的目录，并复用样品瓶放置任务的 "
"MDP；添加不同的操作任务时，创建与 ``tasks/place_vial`` 并列的目录，由新任务管理自己的任务项。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:164
msgid ""
"The registration connects a task ID to the generic manager-based "
"environment, the task configuration, and its default RSL-RL agent:"
msgstr "注册将任务 ID 与通用的基于管理器环境、任务配置和默认 RSL-RL 智能体连接起来："

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:167
msgid "src/isaaclab_tutorial/tasks/place_vial/config/so101/__init__.py"
msgstr "src/isaaclab_tutorial/tasks/place_vial/config/so101/__init__.py"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:181
msgid ""
"This is why the normal ``isaaclab train``, ``play``, and ``benchmark`` "
"commands work without project-local launcher scripts."
msgstr ""
"因此，无需项目专用的启动脚本，常规 ``isaaclab train`` 、 ``play`` 和 ``benchmark`` 命令就能运行这些任务。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:189
msgid ""
"The environment is assembled declaratively with "
":class:`~isaaclab.envs.ManagerBasedRLEnvCfg`. The main configuration "
"connects one scene configuration and one configuration for each MDP manager:"
msgstr ""
"环境通过 :class:`~isaaclab.envs.ManagerBasedRLEnvCfg` 以声明式方式组装。主配置关联一个场景配置，以及各个 "
"MDP 管理器的配置："

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:192
msgid "src/isaaclab_tutorial/tasks/place_vial/config/so101/env_cfg.py"
msgstr "src/isaaclab_tutorial/tasks/place_vial/config/so101/env_cfg.py"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:211
msgid ""
"The 120 Hz simulation and decimation of four give the policy a 30 Hz control"
" rate. ``replicate_physics=True`` allows the same scene to scale across "
"thousands of environments. Values wrapped in ``preset(...)`` change only "
"when the named preset is selected on the command line."
msgstr ""
"仿真频率为 120 Hz，控制降频系数为 4，因此策略控制频率为 30 Hz。``replicate_physics=True`` "
"使同一场景能够扩展到数千个并行环境。只有在命令行中选择相应预设时，``preset(...)`` 包装的值才会改变。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:216
msgid "Scene and control"
msgstr "场景与控制"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:218
msgid ""
"``SO101SceneCfg`` contains a fixed-base SO-101, a free 20 g vial, the four-"
"hole rack, the desk, contact sensors on both jaws and the vial, and lights. "
"The robot configuration, identified actuator dynamics, and limits come from "
"Isaac Lab's ``SO101_CFG``."
msgstr ""
"``SO101SceneCfg`` 包含固定基座的 SO-101、自由运动的 20 g "
"小瓶、四孔瓶架、桌子、两个夹爪和小瓶上的接触传感器，以及灯光。机器人配置、辨识得到的执行器动力学和限制值均来自 Isaac Lab 的 "
"``SO101_CFG``。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:222
msgid ""
"The six-dimensional policy action uses Isaac Lab's relative joint-position "
"action: at every physics step, each joint target is the measured joint "
"position plus the scaled action. The task never attaches the vial to the "
"gripper and never writes its pose after reset. Grasping, transport, "
"insertion, and release must therefore succeed through simulated contact."
msgstr ""
"六维策略动作使用 Isaac Lab "
"的相对关节位置动作：每个物理步中，各关节目标等于实测关节位置加上缩放后的动作。任务不会将小瓶固定到夹爪上，重置后也不会直接写入它的位姿。因此，抓取、搬运、插入和松开都必须通过仿真接触完成。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:228
msgid "MDP at a glance"
msgstr "MDP 概览"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:230
msgid ""
"The task reuses Isaac Lab's core MDP terms and terms from the lift task "
"(``body_state_b``, ``out_of_bound``, ``abnormal_robot_state``), and adds "
"only the terms specific to vial placement."
msgstr ""
"任务复用 Isaac Lab 的核心 MDP "
"项和抬升任务中的项（``body_state_b``、``out_of_bound``、``abnormal_robot_state``），只新增小瓶放置所特有的项。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:237
msgid "Component"
msgstr "组件"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:238
msgid "Contract"
msgstr "约定"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:239
msgid "Actions"
msgstr "动作"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:240
msgid ""
"Five arm-joint offsets of up to 0.033 rad and one jaw offset of up to 0.02 "
"rad from the measured positions."
msgstr "相对于实测位置，五个机械臂关节的偏移量各不超过 0.033 rad，夹爪关节的偏移量不超过 0.02 rad。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:241
msgid "State actor"
msgstr "基于状态的 Actor"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:242
msgid ""
"Joint positions, velocities, and targets, previous action, end-effector and "
"vial state, the vial position in the rack frame, placement features, and "
"latched progress flags."
msgstr "关节位置、速度和目标，上一时刻动作，末端执行器与小瓶状态，瓶架坐标系下的小瓶位置，放置特征，以及触发后保持的进度标记。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:244
msgid "Camera actor"
msgstr "基于相机的 Actor"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:245
msgid ""
"No object state: two stacked 64 by 48 wrist RGB frames plus noisy joint "
"readings, targets, and previous action."
msgstr "不包含物体状态：由两帧堆叠的 64 × 48 腕部 RGB 图像，以及带噪声的关节读数、关节目标和上一时刻动作组成。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:247
msgid "Critic"
msgstr "Critic"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:248
msgid "Privileged state observations plus jaw contact flags."
msgstr "特权状态观测与夹爪接触标记。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:249
msgid "Events"
msgstr "事件"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:250
msgid "Reset-pose sampling and modest vial mass and friction randomization."
msgstr "采样重置位姿，并对样品瓶质量和摩擦进行小幅随机化。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:251
msgid "Rewards"
msgstr "奖励"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:252
msgid ""
"Approach progress toward the cap, held-vial shaping toward the nearest hole,"
" one-time grasp, lift, and insertion milestones, a success bonus, a vial-"
"loss penalty, and small action-rate, joint-velocity, and joint-limit costs."
msgstr ""
"向瓶盖靠近的进度奖励、持瓶向最近孔位靠近的塑形奖励，一次性的抓取、抬升和插入里程碑奖励，成功奖励、丢失小瓶惩罚，以及较小的动作变化率、关节速度和关节限位代价。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:255
msgid "Terminations"
msgstr "终止条件"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:256
msgid ""
"Successful placement, a dropped or out-of-bounds vial, unstable robot state,"
" or the 20 s time limit."
msgstr "成功放置，小瓶掉落或越界，机器人状态不稳定，或达到 20 s 时间上限。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:259
msgid "Physical progress and resets"
msgstr "物理进度与重置"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:261
msgid ""
"Long-horizon manipulation is difficult to learn from the initial tabletop "
"pose alone. The project therefore replays physics-validated reset poses "
"across eight phases:"
msgstr "仅从桌面初始位姿开始，长时程操作任务很难学会。因此，项目在八个阶段中复用经过物理验证的重置位姿："

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:268
msgid ""
"Training samples these phases as a reset curriculum. Each phase remains part"
" of the same task: observations, actions, rewards, and termination criteria "
"do not change. Progress flags advance only when physical evidence is "
"present, for example bilateral jaw contact while the vial is held off the "
"desk. Interactive play returns to phase-zero starts so the final policy must"
" complete the entire task. Read ``mdp/terminations.py`` for the physical "
"success predicate and ``reset/curriculum.py`` for the reset distribution."
msgstr ""
"训练通过重置课程对这些阶段进行采样。各阶段仍属于同一任务，观测、动作、奖励和终止条件均不改变。进度标记只有在出现物理证据后才会推进，例如小瓶离开桌面时两个夹爪均检测到接触。交互回放从第零阶段开始，要求最终策略完成整个任务。物理成功判据见"
" ``mdp/terminations.py``，重置分布见 ``reset/curriculum.py``。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:275
msgid "State and camera policies"
msgstr "状态策略与相机策略"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:277
msgid ""
"``SO101VialEnvCfg`` is the fully observed baseline. "
"``SO101VialCameraEnvCfg`` in ``camera_env_cfg.py`` subclasses it, adds the "
"wrist camera, and replaces the actor observations. It also exposes the state"
" actor's observations as a ``teacher_state`` group, which the state teacher "
"reads during distillation; the deployed student consumes only wrist RGB and "
"proprioception."
msgstr ""
"``SO101VialEnvCfg`` 是全状态可观测的基线。``camera_env_cfg.py`` 中的 "
"``SO101VialCameraEnvCfg`` 继承该配置，添加腕部相机，并替换 actor 的观测。它还通过 ``teacher_state`` "
"观测组提供状态策略的观测，供状态教师在蒸馏期间读取；部署后的学生策略只使用腕部 RGB 图像和本体感知信息。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:285
msgid "4. Validate before training"
msgstr "4. 训练前验证"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:287
msgid ""
"Start with fast checks. They catch broken assets, registration, geometry, "
"rewards, reset data, and configuration contracts before a long GPU run:"
msgstr "先运行快速检查，在长时间 GPU 训练之前发现资源、注册、几何、奖励、重置数据和配置约定中的问题："

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:295
msgid ""
"Next, construct and step a small vectorized environment with zero actions:"
msgstr "接着，构建一个小规模向量化环境，施加零动作并执行步进："

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:301
msgid ""
"If this fails, fix task discovery, asset loading, or simulation stability "
"before tuning RL. When it passes, measure the environment separately from "
"the learning algorithm:"
msgstr "如果检查失败，请先修复任务发现、资源加载或仿真稳定性问题，再调整强化学习。如果检查通过，则独立于学习算法测量环境性能："

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:308
msgid ""
"Reduce ``--num_envs`` if the batch does not fit your GPU. For the camera "
"task, add the Newton renderer preset and start with a smaller batch:"
msgstr "如果当前 GPU 无法容纳该批次，请减小 ``--num_envs`` 。对于相机任务，添加 Newton 渲染器预设，并从较小批次开始："

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:320
msgid ""
"Train the state teacher with RSL-RL. The task's default agent configuration "
"is an 800-iteration run:"
msgstr "使用 RSL-RL 训练基于状态的教师策略。任务的默认智能体配置运行 800 次迭代："

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:326
msgid ""
"Checkpoints and TensorBoard events are written below "
"``logs/rsl_rl/so101_vial_state/<run>``; the final checkpoint is "
"``model_799.pt``. While training runs, inspect the learning curves in "
"another terminal:"
msgstr ""
"检查点和 TensorBoard 事件写入 ``logs/rsl_rl/so101_vial_state/<run>`` 下，最终检查点为 "
"``model_799.pt`` 。训练期间，可在另一个终端中查看学习曲线："

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:333
msgid ""
"Look for rising ``Metrics/success_rate``, not reward alone. A larger return "
"can come from shaping without a corresponding increase in successful "
"placements."
msgstr "应关注 ``Metrics/success_rate`` 是否上升，而不只看奖励。更高的回报可能来自塑形奖励，并不代表成功放置次数增加。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:337
msgid "Play the state teacher"
msgstr "运行状态教师策略"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:339
msgid "Play the trained teacher from the canonical home phase:"
msgstr "从标准初始阶段运行已训练的教师策略："

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:345
msgid ""
"The rollout should start from the canonical home phase, pick up the "
"horizontal vial, turn it upright, move it over a hole, insert it, and open "
"the jaw so gravity seats it in the rack. Playback already uses the policy's "
"deterministic actions. Do not add ``--deterministic``: it also enables "
"Warp's deterministic kernel mode, which this scene's collision and solver "
"kernels exceed."
msgstr ""
"回放应从标准初始阶段开始，依次抓起水平放置的小瓶，将其转为直立，移到孔位上方，插入并张开夹爪，让重力使其落稳在瓶架中。回放已经使用策略的确定性动作，无需添加"
" ``--deterministic``：该参数还会启用 Warp 的确定性内核模式，而本场景的碰撞与求解器内核超出了该模式的限制。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:351
msgid "Distill the wrist-camera policy"
msgstr "蒸馏腕部相机策略"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:355
msgid ""
"The consolidated tutorial uses ``IsaacTutorial-Place-Vial-SO101-Camera`` for"
" distillation. If you followed an earlier version of this page, replace "
"``IsaacTutorial-Place-Vial-SO101-Camera-Distillation`` with that task ID in "
"training and playback commands."
msgstr ""
"整合后的教程使用 ``IsaacTutorial-Place-Vial-SO101-Camera`` "
"进行蒸馏。如果之前参考过旧版页面，请在训练和回放命令中，将 ``IsaacTutorial-Place-Vial-SO101-Camera-"
"Distillation`` 替换为这一任务 ID。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:359
msgid ""
"Pass the finished teacher to the camera task. Add the renderer preset "
"because the student observes wrist RGB:"
msgstr "将训练完成的教师传给相机任务。学生策略使用腕部 RGB 观测，因此需要添加渲染器预设："

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:365
msgid ""
"The camera task's default agent is RSL-RL's DAgger-style distillation "
"runner: the student acts, the frozen teacher labels every visited state, and"
" the labels are clipped to the executed ``[-1, 1]`` action range. Outputs "
"are written below ``logs/rsl_rl/so101_vial_camera_distillation/<run>``."
msgstr ""
"相机任务默认使用 RSL-RL 的 DAgger 式蒸馏运行器：学生执行动作，冻结的教师为每个访问到的状态提供标签，并将标签裁剪到实际执行的 "
"``[-1, 1]`` 动作范围内。输出保存在 ``logs/rsl_rl/so101_vial_camera_distillation/<run>``"
" 下。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:369
msgid "Play the distilled student with the same task ID used for training:"
msgstr "使用与训练时相同的任务 ID 运行蒸馏后的学生策略："

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:376
msgid "Measure the policies"
msgstr "评估策略"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:378
msgid ""
"A visually convincing rollout is not an evaluation. Run the tracked phase-"
"zero start set headlessly with the project's external callback:"
msgstr "一段看起来成功的运行轨迹不能代替评估。通过项目的外部回调，以无界面方式运行已记录的第零阶段起始状态集合："

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:385
msgid "Use the same 1,024-start contract for the distilled policy:"
msgstr "对蒸馏后的策略使用相同的 1024 个起始状态评估约定："

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:391
msgid ""
"The callback runs each tracked start once and prints one "
"``SO101_EVAL_RESULT`` JSON record. Preserve that record, the checkpoint, "
"seed, task ID, and resolved configuration when comparing experiments."
msgstr ""
"回调会将每个跟踪的起始状态运行一次，并打印一条 ``SO101_EVAL_RESULT`` JSON "
"记录。对比实验时，应保留该记录、检查点、随机种子、任务 ID 和解析后的配置。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:395
msgid "Maintain the reset dataset"
msgstr "维护重置数据集"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:397
msgid ""
"The checked-in reset dataset is ready for training. Generate or inspect a "
"separate candidate without overwriting it:"
msgstr "仓库中的重置数据集可直接用于训练。可以另行生成或检查候选数据集，而不覆盖现有数据："

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:407
msgid "Train for the real robot"
msgstr "面向真实机器人的训练"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:409
msgid ""
"``presets=sim2real`` adds the randomization used for robot transfer: "
"contact, joint-dynamics, gain, and encoder variation in both tasks, plus "
"appearance and camera variation in the camera task. Because the physics "
"randomization is shared, the teacher and student train under the same "
"physics. Fine-tune the state teacher with the preset, then distill under the"
" same preset:"
msgstr ""
"``presets=sim2real`` "
"添加向真实机器人迁移所需的随机化：两个任务均包含接触、关节动力学、增益和编码器差异，相机任务还包含外观与相机变化。物理随机化由两个任务共用，因此教师和学生在相同物理条件下训练。先用该预设微调状态教师，再用同一预设进行蒸馏："

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:419
msgid ""
"The repository's ``docs/SIM2REAL.md`` covers the physical setup, robot "
"calibration, policy export, and deployment."
msgstr "仓库中的 ``docs/SIM2REAL.md`` 介绍了实物搭建、机器人标定、策略导出和部署。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:426
msgid ""
"Change one boundary at a time and rerun the tests, zero-agent smoke test, "
"and benchmark before training:"
msgstr "每次只修改一个模块边界，并在训练前重新运行测试、零动作智能体检查和性能测试："

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:432
msgid "Goal"
msgstr "目标"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:433
msgid "Start here"
msgstr "修改位置"

