msgid "Change the scene or SO-101"
msgstr "修改场景或 SO-101"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:435
msgid "``config/so101/env_cfg.py`` and ``assets/``"
msgstr "``config/so101/env_cfg.py`` 和 ``assets/``"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:436
msgid "Change actor inputs"
msgstr "修改 Actor 输入"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:437
msgid "Observation groups in ``env_cfg.py`` or ``camera_env_cfg.py``"
msgstr "``env_cfg.py`` 或 ``camera_env_cfg.py`` 中的观测组"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:438
msgid "Change task behavior"
msgstr "修改任务行为"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:439
msgid "Observation, reward, termination, and event terms in ``mdp/``"
msgstr "``mdp/`` 中的观测、奖励、终止和事件项"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:440
msgid "Change reset coverage"
msgstr "修改重置覆盖范围"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:441
msgid "``reset/curriculum.py`` and the validated reset dataset"
msgstr "``reset/curriculum.py`` 和经过验证的重置数据集"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:442
msgid "Change PPO or distillation"
msgstr "修改 PPO 或蒸馏"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:443
msgid ""
"``config/so101/agents/rsl_rl_ppo_cfg.py`` and ``rsl_rl_distillation_cfg.py``"
msgstr ""
"``config/so101/agents/rsl_rl_ppo_cfg.py`` 和 ``rsl_rl_distillation_cfg.py``"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:444
msgid "Change sim-to-real randomization"
msgstr "修改仿真到现实随机化"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:445
msgid ""
"The ``sim2real`` preset values and ``Sim2RealEventsCfg`` in ``env_cfg.py`` "
"and ``camera_env_cfg.py``"
msgstr ""
"``env_cfg.py`` 和 ``camera_env_cfg.py`` 中的 ``sim2real`` 预设值及 "
"``Sim2RealEventsCfg``"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:446
msgid "Add another robot"
msgstr "添加其他机器人"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:447
msgid ""
"Add ``config/<robot_name>/`` and register new task IDs there; keep the "
"shared MDP robot-agnostic."
msgstr "添加 ``config/<robot_name>/`` ，在其中注册新的任务 ID；共享的 MDP 应保持与具体机器人无关。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:448
msgid "Add another manipulation task"
msgstr "添加其他操作任务"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:449
msgid ""
"Add a sibling of ``tasks/place_vial`` with its own MDP and robot "
"configurations."
msgstr "创建与 ``tasks/place_vial`` 并列的目录，包含新任务自己的 MDP 和机器人配置。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:451
msgid "Keep these invariants as the task evolves:"
msgstr "任务演进过程中，应保持以下约定："

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:453
msgid ""
"Task IDs resolve through the package entry point; do not copy Isaac Lab's "
"launcher scripts."
msgstr "任务 ID 通过软件包入口点解析，无需复制 Isaac Lab 的启动脚本。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:454
msgid "Policy action order and scale match the robot command contract."
msgstr "策略动作的顺序和缩放比例与机器人命令约定一致。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:455
msgid ""
"Physical quantities and quaternions use Isaac Lab's current conventions; "
"Isaac Lab 3 uses XYZW quaternion order."
msgstr "物理量和四元数遵循 Isaac Lab 当前的约定；Isaac Lab 3 使用 XYZW 四元数顺序。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:456
msgid ""
"Resets create valid physical states, and post-reset task code does not "
"teleport the manipulated object."
msgstr "重置生成有效的物理状态，重置后的任务代码不直接瞬移被操作物体。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:457
msgid ""
"Success requires a released, mechanically seated vial rather than proximity "
"to the rack."
msgstr "成功条件要求样品瓶已经松开并在支架中正确落座，不能仅以靠近支架作为成功。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:458
msgid ""
"Tests cover observable task contracts, while a benchmark checks that changes"
" did not move expensive work into the per-environment step loop."
msgstr "测试应覆盖可观测的任务约定，性能测试则检查改动是否将高开销操作移入了每个环境的步进循环。"

#: source/setup/tutorial.rst:461
msgid ""
"From here, use :ref:`Task Design Workflows <feature-workflows>` for the "
"manager/direct architecture, :ref:`Reinforcement Learning <rl-frameworks>` "
"for framework details, and :doc:`Hydra Configuration System "
"</source/features/hydra>` for command-line overrides."
msgstr ""
"接下来，可通过 :ref:`任务设计流程 <feature-workflows>` 了解管理器式与直接式架构，通过 :ref:`强化学习 <rl-"
"frameworks>` 了解框架细节，通过 :doc:`Hydra 配置系统 </source/features/hydra>` "
"了解命令行覆盖配置的方法。"
